  "bodyHash": "xnMwI0in0sk=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ttAOcq3.png\" alt=\"Packed Up 橫幅\" width=\"1903\" height=\"431\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>Packed Up</strong> 讓你能解決庫存問題，透過提供製作<strong>全新驚豔背包</strong>的能力！這讓你能隨身攜帶物品，而不用到處放置那些惱人的箱子！它也是旅行和探索地牢的絕佳選擇！背包還能與 <strong>Baubles</strong>、<strong>Curios</strong> 和 <strong>Trinkets</strong> 一同使用，並可透過按鍵快速開啟！</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OwFkm6a.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"75\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>背包：</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/oMnBXzF.png\" alt=\"標準背包\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;標準背包</strong></h4><p>- 提供 <strong>3 行</strong>儲存空間。</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/281/288/310/172/basic_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"標準背包合成配方\" width=\"310\" height=\"162\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/yu6ubv3.png\" alt=\"鐵背包\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;鐵背包</strong></h4><p><strong>- 由<strong>標準背包</strong>升級</strong></p><p><strong><strong>- 4 行</strong><strong>&nbsp;儲存空間</strong></strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/289/iron_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"鐵背包合成配方\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Ixnb230.png\" alt=\"銅背包\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;銅背包</strong></strong></h4><p>- 由<strong>標準背包</strong>升級</p><p>-&nbsp;<strong>4 行</strong>儲存空間</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/290/copper_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"銅背包合成配方\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/aKX00AL.png\" alt=\"金背包\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;金背包</strong></h4><p>- 由<strong>鐵背包</strong>或<strong>銅背包</strong>升級</p><p>-&nbsp;<strong>5 行</strong>儲存空間</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/291/gold_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"金背包合成配方\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/292/gold_backpack_crafting2.png\" alt=\"金背包合成配方\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/0k4GUoC.png\" alt=\"銀背包\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;銀背包</strong></h4><p>- 由<strong>鐵背包</strong>或<strong>銅背包</strong>升級</p><p>-&nbsp;<strong>5 行</strong>儲存空間</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/293/silver_backpack_crafting2.png\" alt=\"銀背包合成配方\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/294/silver_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"銀背包合成配方\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/bSnWiVc.png\" alt=\"鑽石背包\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;鑽石背包</strong></h4><p>- 由<strong>金背包</strong>或<strong>銀背包</strong>升級</p><p>- <strong>7 行</strong>儲存空間</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/281/295/310/172/diamond_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"鑽石背包合成配方\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/281/296/310/172/diamond_backpack_crafting2.png\" alt=\"鑽石背包合成配方\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Rtk4qvc.png\" alt=\"黑曜石\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;黑曜石背包</strong></h4><p>- 由<strong>鑽石背包</strong>升級</p><p>-&nbsp;<strong>8 行</strong>儲存空間</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/281/297/310/172/obsidian_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"黑曜石背包合成配方\" width=\"310\" height=\"162\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OwFkm6a.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"75\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>背包自定義</h2><h5>背包可以擁有自訂名稱和自訂圖示。要自訂背包，只需在手持時按住 Shift 並右鍵點擊。</h5><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/96/customization.webp\" alt=\"背包自定義\" width=\"400\" height=\"270\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OwFkm6a.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"75\"></p><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><strong>從背包內開啟另一個背包</strong></h3><h5>1. 右鍵點擊背包將其開啟</h5><h5>2. 在背包介面中右鍵點擊另一個背包</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OwFkm6a.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"75\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>常見問題</strong></h3><h4><strong>這個模組會添加銅錠和銀錠嗎？</strong></h4><h5>不會，要製作銅背包和銀背包，你需要一個添加銅錠和銀錠的模組。</h5><h4><strong>我可以更改每個背包的儲存容量嗎？</strong></h4><h5>可以，可以在<strong>設定檔</strong>中更改。</h5><h4><strong>我可以在我的模組包中使用你的模組嗎？</strong></h4><h5>可以，歡迎在我的模組包中使用這個模組。</h5><h5>&nbsp;</h5><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OwFkm6a.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"75\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Discord</strong></h3><h5>如需了解未來內容、即將推出的模組以及討論，歡迎加入 SuperMartijn642 的 Discord 伺服器！</h5><h5><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" width=\"373\" height=\"93\"></a></h5><h5>&nbsp;</h5><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OwFkm6a.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"75\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/287/banner.png\" alt=\"所有可用的背包\" width=\"663\" height=\"109\"></p>",
